Third-party data: the derived data are computed from third-party observations
and products whose own terms and citation requirements also apply to reuse
(docs/third-party-data.md). In particular, data/products/p2/cmorph_pixels.csv
contains NOAA CMORPH CDR values, data/products/p2/p2_glodap.json contains
GLODAPv2.2016b values and data/products/piston-track/piston_track_hourly.csv
contains PISTON ship positions; cite those sources when reusing these files.

